{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_title", "source_sha256": "62c7a1eaec79613f17ac54f21831961e1b605fe0072a52eab22330f546662a6f", "ja": "ある晴れた日の歌声", "zh": "某个晴天的歌声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_synopsis", "source_sha256": "36aa4a31a9b2c4bec22cb206923c0eb0e30a9c5195eaa253b7372dece4c4bd80", "ja": "センターを務めることになった歌織。\nこれまでの合唱の舞台とは違うステージに\n戸惑う彼女だったが、莉緒や亜利沙たちと\nの交流の中で、アイドルになることの意味\nに触れ、仲間と共に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "歌织即将担任Center。\n面对不同于过去合唱团表演的演出，\n她感到有些迷惘。但在和莉绪及亚利沙的\n互动中，歌织渐渐了解何谓偶像，\n并和伙伴们一起顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3bd27458da4d70a2ed69b316a461f90428788df605231c4a01b966d0aff50f5b", "ja": "（歌織さんの初センターが終わった。見事な歌唱力で\nお客さんを魅了した光景は、さすがのひと言だった）", "zh": "（歌织小姐的第一次Center表演结束了。\n客人们深受她精湛歌艺吸引的景象，让人真心佩服。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "6dd2476cb03ac73a54dd789f92ceb3bb9302f3c0d6daeb0fb3fd56ee6ab9b491", "ja": "ありさは……ありさは、感動しました！", "zh": "亚利沙……亚利沙好感动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "21ff3d5e2281b9fba3437bdc52bb4d015a5cca308967afa2081c9ad9de1ed69f", "ja": "ステージの真ん中で堂々と歌い上げる歌織さん……\nその姿はまさに地上に降りた天使そのものですっ！", "zh": "站在舞台正中央，昂首歌唱的歌织姊……\n那模样简直就是降临人间的天使！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c7b822cad4a5455bad89e40dc4c770284bc592e5ff54937b32cc3183b5368984", "ja": "たまきね、たまきね、すっごく楽しかった！　かおりの\n歌を聞いてると、勝手に体が動いちゃったんだ～！", "zh": "环啊、环啊，超级开心喔！\n听到歌织的歌声，身体就自己动起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "d1fd2cea8852550e41048d510f3bd827e6ba53627ca1cc443ea2cc5b63f9ab74", "ja": "くふふ……かおり、また一緒に公演に出ようねっ♪", "zh": "呵呵……歌织，我们要再一起参加公演喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "e6cc42a7b664ef02318b81706e2181ae53b531175f816dd955a378c51e3f7395", "ja": "亜利沙ちゃん、環ちゃん……ありがとう♪\n私もみんなとステージに立てて、本当に良かったわ！", "zh": "亚利沙、小环……谢谢你们♪\n能和大家一起站上舞台表演，我也觉得很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "bc1b2c4bb89b817117104af7a776db618b7c2b36e5ea046a9ccbf6c592406399", "ja": "私もなの。亜利沙ちゃん、環ちゃんを見ているだけで、\n自然と気持ちが……どこまでも高まっていって！", "zh": "我也和你们一样。光是看着亚利沙和小环，\n心情就自然而然地……变得十分高亢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "14c937994120eea43556ff50e602875b6887cda15691cdf32896a820e33b3794", "ja": "仲間と一緒に飛び出して、最高に輝けましたね。\n歌織さんらしい、本当にいいステージでした。", "zh": "和同伴一起全力投入表演的歌织小姐，散发出了最耀眼的\n光芒呢。这是场很棒，很有歌织小姐风格的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "4d335911a120aa91852f4cb4787de14ba3990d7f8dc9d53bc0befda3b45731c0", "ja": "ええ、初めてのセンターって言われても信じられない\nくらい素敵だったわ。さすが、歌織ちゃんね♪", "zh": "对啊，精彩到让人不敢相信这是你第一次当Center呢，\n真不愧是小歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "26f2e8886cfe05d5f634d1ae740be7a86b8272187c92c96c19b41e0ccd0c95ff", "ja": "さすがだなんて。私だけ褒めるのはやめてね、\n莉緒ちゃん。だって……。", "zh": "我没有那么厉害，不要只夸我一个人啦，莉绪。\n因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "d3d3ca3b2db2847b2ce8cf3700230e78c86785f9c988ca5138871ff5387f9231", "ja": "女は度胸、アイドルも度胸。\nその度胸は、みんながくれたモノなんだから♪", "zh": "女人要有胆量，偶像也要有胆量。\n而那份胆量，是大家给我的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "45a24d5e79aa208d0a8bb8d87c8059d9a5724f6b69c76d863e330b4ece89b2f7", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\n成功するのも失敗するのも、みんな一緒！", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。\n不论成功或失败，大家都要一起经历！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "0248ec77ce2bd9c85cde5153098a4d61f7effc8d4108fc5aa98480fab927d6ea", "ja": "どきょー？", "zh": "胆量？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "873f9411d8290e682b92c2f829a7bfc86cf971b910c5f12af80fe3de900002aa", "ja": "ムムッ、キョーミ深い発言です！\n莉緒さん、どういうお話なのか教えてくださいっ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，这句话真深奥！\n莉绪姊，请告诉亚利沙这句话的意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "d31daec47542a6f246b0157bde3461c6c20fbcef2c5032537c3f4ded117b7733", "ja": "ふふ、打ち上げでゆっくりとね。\nまずはシャワーを浴びて、サッパリしたいし～♪", "zh": "呵呵，庆功宴时我们再慢慢聊吧。\n我想先去冲个澡，让整个人清爽一点～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "6dccf8bfcf982145ce3b0a25eb5768b91be40b446b3bd0a48a234f24e567ac68", "ja": "あ、待ってください！？\n今、教えてくださいよぉ～！", "zh": "啊，请等一下！？\n现在就告诉亚利沙嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "3cd77ae5e8f86985fd2a0f726d2a9210a3620b69eadb1849082713f1d8f7eba8", "ja": "なになに！？　りおとありさ、かけっこするのっ？\nたまきもする！　混ぜて混ぜて～！", "zh": "什么什么！？莉绪和亚利沙要赛跑吗？\n环也要！让环加入、让环加入～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "720b70767df2b2c9bf6b7325f73b88fcb6cba498d150a196fe392c1e37ec7d3e", "ja": "やれやれ。公演が終わったばかりなのに、\nみんな、まだまだ元気ですね……。", "zh": "真是的，公演明明才刚结束，\n大家还这么有精神啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "335656451c871daa1172db5c16fb09eac0de9dcd11ba0757ef8763897401055b", "ja": "…………。{$P$}さん。", "zh": "…………{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "823a0fcefc5c417d9e0d0e8e7b15287aef576b8be93e2ad494af87de524e6da4", "ja": "はい、なんですか？", "zh": "是，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "370179e42f8fb4272e5a898f7d0860d6651e3b4fa48adb1e2b80337d7ade50c7", "ja": "私、今回のステージで、\n思いきって本番に飛び出してみて……。", "zh": "在这次的公演中，\n我下定决心登台表演之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "10d42b4b64ae6fb25146eef53f7943ac66f74d4a484e2c534ac7ba025ab35639", "ja": "今までと違う、新しい世界が見えた気がします。", "zh": "好像看到了不同于以往的新世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4158585b859b5b30491342471561838a1fc2088b038595bb0f6c51a91572d0b0", "ja": "どんな世界が見えたんですか？", "zh": "是什么样的世界呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "f7ff884303a59085b4a197a57be03dc7084e563bae0a5a32899078e71cb96823", "ja": "客席のみなさんの笑顔を、あんなにたくさん……、\nあんなに近くで感じられる世界……。", "zh": "能在那么近的距离，\n感受到台下观众满满笑容的世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "3b8ee98a5725faf62a029f1ed154220b8cc432ad583f0b867d49ba3e6e350ae1", "ja": "まぶしいくらい、みなさんの心が輝いて……。\n喜びにあふれた世界が広がっていて……。", "zh": "大家的心都闪闪发亮，甚至让人觉得刺眼……\n充满喜悦的世界在我眼前展开……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "8744306c9b05fc00c835750aefc6a1882e0a96690ff3aa2eb2576f7eff464c15", "ja": "ステージで輝くのは、アイドル……。でも本当は、\nあの場にいるみんな、なのかもしれませんね！", "zh": "原本以为只有偶像才能在舞台上发光发热……\n但其实散发出光芒的，说不定是在场的所有人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fd5c81ce57181337653efadaa3e41ddd23cc3670eece07f6a3d7df36e40ef77c", "ja": "そうですね。\nきっと、その通りだと思います。", "zh": "是啊，\n一定就像你说的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "1864d4a5c83511c993124b7e867d9626487d1cb22d760e58b982d2719f6c0d68", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n私、これからも色々なことに挑戦していきたいです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我以后想要挑战更多各式各样的事物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "387134e91630892f8da73f59c656d2cf32c4010aabc2f658daf0053d62ba04bf", "ja": "今日、感じさせてもらったときめきを……。\n私、また経験したいです！", "zh": "今天在心中感受到的这份悸动……\n我还想要再次体验！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d6beea29aceec0fcb8cfe678d9f4c86c3b52fd01b9fac85689871713e8246bf4", "ja": "経験しましょう、一緒に。\nまた踏み出せない時があったら、俺に言ってください。", "zh": "让我们一起去体验吧。\n如果又遇到难以跨出步伐的情况时，请跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1030_p", "source_sha256": "33f02a30bd9ade6c509c69cfc56a4c63d9a5c20f8030ef7e9346a10f1fdabd12", "ja": "いくらでも、背中を押しますから！", "zh": "不管什么时候，我都会助你一臂之力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "c229ff995fbd22f72a09782c0ae65c5e4e9512de85fb3d8aeeff5aba633b115c", "ja": "はい！　ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "好的！谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b410b79841b982b998b7dfccb80736d02a3cfb4aabfbbb6d755301277b553f31", "ja": "（挑戦する楽しさを知った歌織さんは、\nこれから天高く羽ばたいていくだろう）", "zh": "（了解到挑战乐趣的歌织小姐，\n未来将会尽情展翅高飞吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1caffecaae8771b8a4be8ff1ef974646003b58d703dce080dd2701ea2e482c0a", "ja": "（歌織さんが奏でる歌のハーモニーのように。\nみんなの応援という風に乗って！）", "zh": "（如同歌织小姐优美和谐的歌声般，\n乘着大家的声援化成的风！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
